WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:04.338
Dear, Astronaut Snoopy
In recognition of your

00:00:04.338 --> 00:00:06.173
achievement as the
beagle on the moon,

00:00:06.548 --> 00:00:08.717
NASA will be dedicating 
a statue in your honor.

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:10.802
That's my boy.

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:12.221
Astronaut Snoopy.

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:15.307
[Sighs]

00:00:17.226 --> 00:00:18.977
Everyone, I think we 
may have found a signal

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:20.312
from intelligent alien life.

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:24.566
I've been training my
whole life for this.

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:26.151
Time to get to work.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:26.902
Ready.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:27.653
Ready.

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:28.236
Ready.

00:00:29.655 --> 00:00:31.031
Snoopy, do you copy?

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:34.576
[Thumbs up]

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:41.208
Yes indeed.

00:00:48.632 --> 00:00:50.384
[SCREAMS]

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:56.014
[LAUGHS]

00:00:58.392 --> 00:00:59.559
I'll go get a mop.

